 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":229794,"global_rank":112913},{"name":"symblai/docusaurus-plugin-munchkin","owner":"symblai","html_url":"https://github.com/symblai/docusaurus-plugin-munchkin","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Plugin which adds Marketo Munchkin script to docusaurus","topics":[],"score":229793,"global_rank":112916},{"name":"MollsReis/nsqfun","owner":"MollsReis","html_url":"https://github.com/MollsReis/nsqfun","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"NSQ Fun","topics":["docker-compose","map-reduce","nodejs","nsq","nsqd"],"score":229781,"global_rank":112924},{"name":"mccarthydev/coloredbalz","owner":"mccarthydev","html_url":"https://github.com/mccarthydev/coloredbalz","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"My first javascript game, you have 5 seconds to memorize the colors of the balls. Score more and more in each turn","topics":[],"score":229781,"global_rank":112925},{"name":"kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","owner":"kwokwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Created for UW iGEM 2018/Experimentation","topics":[],"score":229781,"global_rank":112926}]